pgg-c02-e04-i8	the black winter coat; a black winter coat	Accusative: the requested item is the direct object; a masculine adjective takes -en after either article (§§2.2, 6.1).
pgg-c02-e04-i9	the red roses; red roses	Accusative: the requested items are direct objects; a plural adjective takes -en after the definite article and -e without one (§§2.2, 6.1).
pgg-c02-e04-i10	the ripe avocado; a ripe avocado	Accusative: the requested item is the direct object; a feminine adjective takes -e after either article (§§2.2, 6.1).
