The first validation pass is clean: 7/7 blocks, 82/82 unique IDs, valid JSON, allowed tags only, and every `<i>` span is an exact normalized substring of its source block. I’ve also tightened the few longest rationales and am doing the final rubric/translation/reference audit now.
