       "solution_en": "One day, I hope to travel all the way down the Rhine.",
       "why_en": "Genitive marks an indefinite day; accusative with the motion verb marks the distance travelled (§§2.3.3, 2.2.2)."
     },
     {
       "id": "pgg-c02-e05-i7",
